WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:01.210 --> 00:00:03.630
[TOWNSPERSON Y]
You're leaving
already, Lord Oden?

3
00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:06.550
He may cause trouble,
but I'll still miss him.

4
00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:09.360
<b>Hakumai

Wano</b>

5
00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:09.800
I heard word there's
a monster living in Kuri.

6
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:12.430
An ogre called Ashura Doji!

7
00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:15.220
Kuri's a blight on this land.

8
00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:17.850
Even the shogun
cannot control it.

9
00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:20.480
If a criminal
takes refuge in Kuri,

10
00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:22.900
the authorities are powerless
to apprehend him.

11
00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:25.530
But if they lack the strength
to survive there,

12
00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:27.740
they'll be chewed up
and spit out.

13
00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:31.580
It's a lawless land,
almost like a different country.

14
00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:36.300
Interesting! Perhaps I should
take a tour around Wano.

15
00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:38.420
[TOWNSPERSON AA]
Have a safe trip, Oden!

16
00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:38.710
[gasps, sighs]

17
00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:42.760
[TOWNSPERSON AB]
Kin! Denjiro!
Come visit us again!

18
00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:44.140
[KIN'EMON, DENJIRO]
See ya!

19
00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:47.730
He shows up uninvited
and leaves just as suddenly.

20
00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:49.230
He values his freedom!

21
00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:50.560
[SUBORDINATE B]
Lord Yasuie!

22
00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:51.560
[YASUIE]
Hm?

23
00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:53.770
Come look! Hurry!

24
00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:56.820
This is the room that
Lord Oden stayed in!

25
00:00:56.820 --> 00:00:59.200
Why on earth would he
do such a thing?

26
00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:02.160
We must send him a bill
for repairs at once!

27
00:01:03.030 --> 00:01:06.370
[YASUIE]
Let's just pretend
there was a natural disaster.

28
00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:09.460
If you're too soft on him,
he'll take advantage of you!

29
00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:11.750
[SUBORDINATE C]
Lord Yasuie!

30
00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:13.630
What is it now?

31
00:01:15.170 --> 00:01:17.090
[YASUIE]
The money is missing?

32
00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:20.010
[SUBORDINATE C]
Yes. I'm certain
I put it in the safe, my lord!

33
00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:22.140
– [OROCHI] Um...
– Hm?

34
00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:25.850
[OROCHI]
It pains me dearly to say this,

35
00:01:25.850 --> 00:01:29.270
but I'm afraid that
the money was stolen.

36
00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:33.060
I saw it. It was Lord Oden.

37
00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:35.690
He slipped it into his robe
and walked away, without a word.

38
00:01:35.690 --> 00:01:38.480
– [both gasp]
– I knew it was that scoundrel!

39
00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:40.990
Biting the hand that feeds him
is what he's doing!

40
00:01:40.990 --> 00:01:42.110
He'll pay!

41
00:01:42.110 --> 00:01:44.740
Would Oden bother being sneaky?

42
00:01:45.870 --> 00:01:48.410
Are you sure, Orochi?

43
00:01:48.410 --> 00:01:50.290
[OROCHI]
Yes! Forgive me!

44
00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:51.580
I was too afraid.

45
00:01:51.580 --> 00:01:54.330
I should have made
an effort to stop him!

46
00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:05.300
[NARRATOR]
After leaving Hakumai,

47
00:02:05.300 --> 00:02:08.300
Oden and his followers
continued onward to Kuri,

48
00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:11.640
causing trouble
all along the way.

49
00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:21.110
[ODEN]
How much longer
are you going to follow me?

50
00:02:21.110 --> 00:02:22.320
Why, forever!

51
00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:24.490
Because we're your
biggest fans, Lord Oden!

52
00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:26.820
[Oden groans]

53
00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:30.910
[DENJIRO, KIN'EMON]
– He's annoyed.
– He's annoyed.

54
00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:36.700
[ODEN]
Hey! Why are you standing
in the rain, you idiots?

55
00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:39.200
As your retainers,
we must protect you!

56
00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:40.920
Come on,
you're going to get sick!

57
00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:44.040
[both]
On our way!

58
00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:45.880
What are you doing in here?

59
00:02:45.880 --> 00:02:47.630
I am writing a journal.

60
00:02:47.630 --> 00:02:49.720
They say it is
a navigator's duty,

61
00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:52.680
a daily observance
on ships overseas.

62
00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:55.680
[NARRATOR]
The following are
excerpts from Oden's journal,

63
00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:58.350
chronicling his adventures.

64
00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:03.500
<b>Ringo</b>

65
00:03:07.610 --> 00:03:10.200
[ODEN]
In Ringo, we met
some ragged little runts.

66
00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:12.400
A pair of starving siblings.

67
00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:14.720
<b>Izo

Son of a Former Hanayanagi

Dance School Headmaster</b>

68
00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:14.720
<b>Kikunojo

Izo's Younger Brother</b>

69
00:03:14.780 --> 00:03:16.530
Get out of here!

70
00:03:20.290 --> 00:03:22.120
[ODEN]
They tried to
earn money by dancing,

71
00:03:22.120 --> 00:03:24.750
but people were
as cold as the snow.

72
00:03:30.880 --> 00:03:33.680
[ODEN]
Why do you little
urchins keep following me?

73
00:03:35.010 --> 00:03:36.640
That food isn't yours!

74
00:03:36.640 --> 00:03:37.080
– [IZO] Seconds.
– Are you listening?

75
00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:38.640
Are you listening?
Put that back!

76
00:03:38.640 --> 00:03:40.180
Put that back!

77
00:03:40.180 --> 00:03:43.060
[ODEN]
They were the children of
a great master of dance,

78
00:03:43.060 --> 00:03:46.110
but their family split apart
when their father was arrested.

79
00:03:46.110 --> 00:03:49.190
They brazenly ate our oden
without my permission,

80
00:03:49.190 --> 00:03:53.200
sobbing all the while,
impossible to deter.

81
00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:55.660
[Kanjiro cackles]

82
00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:54.660
[Townsperson C screams]

83
00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:56.130
[screams]

84
00:03:58.010 --> 00:03:59.260
[Townsperson C cries]

85
00:03:59.930 --> 00:04:02.350
<b>Kibi</b>

86
00:04:01.580 --> 00:04:04.210
[ODEN]
In Kibi, there was
a goblin of a man,

87
00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:07.000
who cut the hair off of
the living and dead alike,

88
00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:09.000
carrying it away into the night.

89
00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:11.130
As it turns out, he sold brushes

90
00:04:11.130 --> 00:04:13.340
made from human
hair for a living.

91
00:04:13.340 --> 00:04:17.310
[cackles]

92
00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:19.320
<b>Kanjuro
Ghoul of Kibi</b>

93
00:04:22.060 --> 00:04:24.270
[KANJURO]
Whoa! I give up! I give up!

94
00:04:24.270 --> 00:04:25.600
I thought you were dead!

95
00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:27.480
[ODEN]
After I gave him a good wallop,

96
00:04:27.480 --> 00:04:29.690
he strangely decided
to follow me.

97
00:04:29.690 --> 00:04:31.320
He claimed to be a
long-suffering victim

98
00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:34.650
of persecution,
but he likely deserved it.

99
00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:43.300
<b>Udon</b>

100
00:04:34.650 --> 00:04:36.400
In the deep forests of Udon,

101
00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:38.410
tales of a notorious
mountain bandit

102
00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:40.120
were carried on the wind.

103
00:04:40.120 --> 00:04:44.330
They say he would abduct women
and beat men half to death.

104
00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:45.040
[crying]

105
00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:46.960
Why are you following me, too?

106
00:04:46.960 --> 00:04:49.210
– Funny, right?
– [Kanjiro laughs]

107
00:04:49.210 --> 00:04:51.210
[all laugh]

108
00:04:57.440 --> 00:04:59.320
Is that the mountain bandit?

109
00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:01.030
[gasps]

110
00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:04.700
Lord Oden!

111
00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:13.540
<b>Raizo

Former Member of

the Kozuki Clan's Oniwabanshu</b>

112
00:05:05.410 --> 00:05:08.870
[ODEN]
In truth, the "bandit"
was a skilled ninja, Raizo,

113
00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:11.240
who quit the Kozuki
Clan's Oniwabanshu

114
00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:13.750
after a kunoichi
broke his heart.

115
00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:16.330
I can't live my life
in hiding anymore!

116
00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:21.840
Please take me with you! [cries]

117
00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:23.380
[gasps]

118
00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:33.230
<b>Lawless Land of Kuri</b>

119
00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:27.540
[RAIZO]
He's annoyed!

120
00:05:34.610 --> 00:05:39.780
<b>Ashura Doji
Strongest Monster in Kuri</b>

121
00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:38.020
Kozuki Oden came here?

122
00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:41.940
He's the son of the shogun.
Killing him should be fun!

123
00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:43.490
Go and bring him to me!

124
00:05:43.490 --> 00:05:45.110
[BANDITS]
Yessir!

125
00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:53.580
[sighs]

126
00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:54.910
More than anything,

127
00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:58.250
I love to see the high
and mighty brought low.

128
00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:02.460
Hey, where did Oden go?

129
00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:05.050
He went to take a dump. I think.

130
00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:07.340
Been a while.
That was yesterday!

131
00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:08.590
You know how he is,

132
00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:10.600
he'll disappear for
a day or two on a whim,

133
00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:11.850
with no explanation.

134
00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:13.560
[gasps]
He went south!

135
00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:15.770
Isn't there a gate
to Kuri south of here?

136
00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:17.350
[RAIZO]
You're right!

137
00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:18.650
Damn it all!

138
00:06:18.650 --> 00:06:20.150
I told him I would die for him,

139
00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:23.360
and then I let him
sneak off to battle alone!

140
00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:35.450
<b>Kuri</b>

141
00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:54.770
[Bandits chuckling]

142
00:06:54.770 --> 00:06:57.770
[ODEN]
The place I entered
was like a different world.

143
00:06:57.770 --> 00:07:00.900
The stench of death filled
the air and a violent wave,

144
00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:05.150
thick like blood,
seemed to aim itself at me.

145
00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:09.780
Time to say goodbye
to your head, Kozuki Oden.

146
00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:57.890
<b>Daimyo and Retainers</b>

147
00:08:57.810 --> 00:09:01.110
So you're the famous
Kozuki Oden.

148
00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:05.980
[ODEN]
I've been disavowed.
I no longer have a name!

149
00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:09.110
[SHUTENMARU]
Anyone can enter,
but those who try to leave

150
00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:10.860
will be promptly killed.

151
00:09:10.860 --> 00:09:14.080
Especially samurai like you!

152
00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:18.000
[Bandits cackle]

153
00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:21.920
[ODEN]
Sounds suffocating.

154
00:09:23.170 --> 00:09:24.590
You've made a cage.

155
00:09:24.590 --> 00:09:27.590
Why chain yourself
when you can be free?

156
00:09:27.590 --> 00:09:30.090
[SHUTENMARU]
I didn't ask for your input.

157
00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:31.970
You were foolish enough
to come here,

158
00:09:31.970 --> 00:09:34.430
so here you'll remain
until your death,

159
00:09:34.430 --> 00:09:36.560
which I expect will be imminent!

160
00:09:36.560 --> 00:09:41.560
[chuckles]
So no one can leave?
Now it's personal!

161
00:09:41.560 --> 00:09:43.480
That's my least favorite rule!

162
00:09:43.480 --> 00:09:47.070
It's my turf,
so they're my rules!

163
00:09:47.070 --> 00:09:48.820
Now die!

164
00:09:51.030 --> 00:09:55.410
[Bandits yell]

165
00:10:01.920 --> 00:10:07.090
[yells]

166
00:10:34.420 --> 00:10:37.380
[all]
– Oden!
– Oden!

167
00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:40.340
We're coming,
just stay where you are!

168
00:10:40.340 --> 00:10:44.140
Huh? Look! He must have
broken through that gate!

169
00:10:45.440 --> 00:10:49.280
[crying]

170
00:10:45.640 --> 00:10:49.230
[both grunting]

171
00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:56.040
This "hellhole" is the only home
that I will ever know!

172
00:10:56.040 --> 00:10:59.420
A pampered bastard like you
could never understand my life!

173
00:10:59.420 --> 00:10:59.740
Are you telling me this is
the life that you want?!

174
00:10:59.740 --> 00:11:03.460
Are you telling me this is
the life that you want?

175
00:11:03.460 --> 00:11:04.460
[all gasp]

176
00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:10.820
We're here, Oden!

177
00:11:14.740 --> 00:11:18.950
[all gasp]

178
00:11:18.950 --> 00:11:22.040
[KIN'EMON]
Oden! We'll help you fight!

179
00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:28.540
[ODEN]
You're a moment too late.

180
00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:32.090
I just wrapped up here.
My apologies.

181
00:11:32.090 --> 00:11:36.720
I fought all day and
all night, but it is done.

182
00:11:41.480 --> 00:11:43.900
[all gasp]

183
00:11:45.190 --> 00:11:47.650
Why don't you kill me already?

184
00:11:47.650 --> 00:11:50.270
I know there's no future for me!

185
00:11:50.820 --> 00:11:53.400
I'll die with no regrets!

186
00:11:53.780 --> 00:11:58.320
Is this Ashura Doji?
Their leader?

187
00:11:58.700 --> 00:12:01.160
[ODEN]
Listen to me, all of you.

188
00:12:01.160 --> 00:12:05.080
Are you still willing to
follow me, to the bitter end?

189
00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:07.420
[all gasp]

190
00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:11.180
[ODEN]
I need your aid,
your strength, your wit.

191
00:12:11.180 --> 00:12:16.230
For I have decided to lift up
the people of this cursed land.

192
00:12:17.510 --> 00:12:20.300
By becoming their king.

193
00:12:24.140 --> 00:12:26.930
<b>Flower

Capital</b>

194
00:12:27.860 --> 00:12:31.490
[gasps]

195
00:12:32.780 --> 00:12:35.990
[BANZABURO]
I come bearing
news of Young Lord Oden!

196
00:12:35.990 --> 00:12:39.200
What happened?
What did he do this time?

197
00:12:39.200 --> 00:12:44.000
[panting]
Take a look!

198
00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:45.000
[Sukiyaki gasps]

199
00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:46.130
[Townspeople cheering]

200
00:12:46.130 --> 00:12:47.930
Kuri has been tamed.

201
00:12:47.930 --> 00:12:49.090
[Onimaru barks]

202
00:12:49.590 --> 00:12:52.350
Only Oden could accomplish this.

203
00:12:52.350 --> 00:12:55.560
I see it, but I can
scarcely believe it.

204
00:12:57.600 --> 00:13:00.230
[NARRATOR]
The people of Kuri
were rough around the edges,

205
00:13:00.230 --> 00:13:02.270
but filled with
boundless energy.

206
00:13:02.270 --> 00:13:04.110
Thanks to Oden's
loyal companions

207
00:13:04.110 --> 00:13:05.740
and headstrong leadership,

208
00:13:05.740 --> 00:13:08.610
they turned their blood-soaked
land into a place worth living,

209
00:13:08.610 --> 00:13:11.820
and the rest of Wano
could not help but notice.

210
00:13:11.820 --> 00:13:12.950
[chuckles]

211
00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:17.830
[all cheer]

212
00:13:17.830 --> 00:13:19.960
[NARRATOR]
In response
to this accomplishment,

213
00:13:19.960 --> 00:13:23.500
the Shogun, Kozuki Sukiyaki,
retracted his disavowal,

214
00:13:23.500 --> 00:13:27.460
and instead gave his son
the title "Daimyo of Kuri."

215
00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:30.660
<b>Reformation 
of
 Kuri</b>

216
00:13:27.460 --> 00:13:29.050
[TOWNSPERSON A]
Look! Lord Oden is gonna be

217
00:13:29.050 --> 00:13:30.930
a daimyo for real now!

218
00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:34.000
<b>Reformation 
of
 Kuri</b>

219
00:13:30.930 --> 00:13:32.470
[TOWNSPERSON B]
Yeah!

220
00:13:32.470 --> 00:13:34.510
[TOWNSPERSON C]
Then Kuri will
be a full-fledged province!

221
00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:37.330
<b>Reformation 
of
 Kuri</b>

222
00:13:34.510 --> 00:13:35.680
[TOWNSPERSON D]
We pulled it off!

223
00:13:35.680 --> 00:13:38.220
All that hard work was worth it!

224
00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:41.590
<b>Reformation 
of
 Kuri</b>

225
00:13:42.520 --> 00:13:44.230
Kin's all right.

226
00:13:47.530 --> 00:13:49.780
We knew you could do it
from the start, Lord Oden!

227
00:13:49.780 --> 00:13:51.070
We're so proud of you!

228
00:13:51.070 --> 00:13:52.660
Congratulations, Oden!

229
00:13:52.660 --> 00:13:53.910
Now Kuri will finally be...

230
00:13:53.910 --> 00:13:55.530
[all gasp]

231
00:14:01.370 --> 00:14:02.040
friends!

232
00:14:11.230 --> 00:14:13.360
[all laughing]

233
00:14:19.070 --> 00:14:21.610
You're looking dour, Ashura.

234
00:14:22.070 --> 00:14:24.040
This is new to me.

235
00:14:24.040 --> 00:14:27.870
[SHUTENMARU]
I have never known peace before.

236
00:14:30.130 --> 00:14:32.920
Thank you, Oden! I owe you my...

237
00:14:32.920 --> 00:14:36.130
Stop it! You're creeping me out!

238
00:14:38.590 --> 00:14:42.800
[Shutenmaru growls]
I was being sincere!

239
00:14:45.930 --> 00:14:49.440
[Shutenmaru yells]

240
00:14:50.090 --> 00:14:50.510
celebrating!

241
00:14:50.510 --> 00:14:54.810
You know, a proper Daimyo
needs retainers.

242
00:14:54.810 --> 00:14:58.980
I'm sure there are many
wise and prudent candidates.

243
00:14:58.430 --> 00:14:59.810
[all gasp]

244
